/uni04A3 % /endescendercyrillic CYRILLIC SMALL LETTER EN WITH DESCENDER (giovanni)
/uni04A5 % /enghecyrillic CYRILLIC SMALL LIGATURE EN GHE (giovanni)
/uni04C8 % /enhookcyrillic CYRILLIC SMALL LETTER EN WITH HOOK (giovanni)
% 0xB0
/uni04E9 % /obarredcyrillic CYRILLIC SMALL LETTER BARRED O (giovanni)
/cyrsacrs       % CYRILLIC SMALL LETTER ES WITH STROKE
